VisualSyslog modernization fork

The original Visual Syslog Server was created by Max Belkov and is available at:
https://github.com/MaxBelkov/visualsyslog

The original project is licensed under GNU General Public License version 2. This fork retains the GPL-2.0 license. New Python modules in this modernization are a clean reimplementation and do not copy the original C++ implementation. Historical original source files remain in the source/ and sourcecommon/ directories.
